#!/bin/sh
# pro1x-sleep suspend|hibernate — as root (sudo, from pro1x-power-menu).
# Untested on the Pro¹x (2026-10-31); hibernate needs swap and a resume
# device, which the port does not set up yet.
case "${1:-}" in
    suspend) echo mem > /sys/power/state ;;
    hibernate) echo disk > /sys/power/state ;;
    *) echo "usage: pro1x-sleep suspend|hibernate" >&2; exit 1 ;;
esac
